    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Adobe is a public company founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, CA, USA, trading as ADBE. Its website describes Adobe Express as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool for making social content, videos, logos, and more. The site says AI Assistant 2 allows users to prompt, create, and edit anything, with quick edits and layer refinement while keeping the parts they love intact.\n\nAdobe's AI products include Adobe Firefly for image generation, Premiere Pro AI for professional video with generative extend and color match, Adobe Podcast AI for audio enhancement with speech enhancement and microphone check, and Adobe Express AI, a lightweight design AI for quick content creation with Adobe Firefly integration. The company describes these products as commercial-safe, with Firefly, Premiere Pro AI, and Adobe Podcast AI carrying commercial-safe training claims.\n\nAdobe's most recent 10-K covers a revenue period ending 2025-11-28 and reports revenue of $23,769,000,000. California law exposure records list 281 entries for Adobe. The company's CIK is 0000796343.",
